B.a65=new A.HW("Taming the storm","Tame the Storm","The nervous system can feel like weather you did not choose. Taming it means learning the shape of that weather: when to slow down, when to stay, and when a tool stays closed. Like Sun Wukong learning to hold his own chaos, this is practice in self-regulation.",null,"assets/brand/monkey_king.png",null)
B.a64=new A.HW("On this device","Zero Tracking. Zero Guilt.","Check-ins, journal entries, and sensor readings stay on this device. There is no account, no streak, and no score for the days you were away. Nothing here is sent or sold.","MonkeyThrive is a supportive self-regulation tool. It does not replace professional therapy. If you are in immediate danger, contact emergency services.",null,null)
